A. EXACT FACTS (as BS2; enumeration over the C(8,4) = 70 relabelings)
  attainable p <= 0.05: 1/70 = 0.0143, 2/70 = 0.0286, 3/70 = 0.0429; 4/70 = 0.0571 is not
  size under exchangeable continuous values: 3/70 = 0.0429; the fill (BS2 power_bs2.out A, same rule): one MISSING -> filled p >= 36/70, one per arm >= 51/70, two controls >= 56/70
  multiplicity: 3 efficacy secondaries (SEC-CMD, SEC-MARGIN, SEC-MECH) at 3/70 each: P(any SUPPORTED | global null, exchangeable) <= 9/70 = 0.1286 (Bonferroni bound); Bonferroni level 0.05/3 = 0.0167 >= 1/70 = 0.0143, so only p = 1/70 survives
  with the guard secondary SEC-TAIL2 too (4 at 3/70): <= 12/70 = 0.1714; 0.05/4 = 0.0125 < 1/70: no p could survive a Bonferroni over 4, which is why the guard is kept out of the efficacy family

